OL,3,GNEWSAThree injured in multi-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash near Edinburgh Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after multi-vehicle crash on
OL,8,Fthe A8 near Edinburgh Airport.
OL,10,FThe incident at about 09:20, between
OL,11,Fthe Newbridge and Gogar roundabouts,
OL,12,Fled to long delays for drivers trying
OL,13,Fto reach the terminal.
OL,15,FThe Scottish Ambulance Service (SAS)
OL,16,Fdispatched three ambulances, two
OL,17,Fspecial operations response teams, a
OL,18,Fparamedic response unit and a critical
OL,19,Fcare paramedic.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
