OL,3,GNEWSAThree injured in multi-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash near Edinburgh Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdinburgh Airport urged passengers to
OL,7,Fallow additional time to reach the
OL,8,Fairport and consider alternative modes
OL,9,Fof transport where possible.
